WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
A controller decision moves real water.
MiniWater illustrates the physical effect of PLC commands.

00:05.000 --> 00:10.000
One false input changes the command.
The drainage pump stops too early.

00:10.000 --> 00:15.000
Inflow continues, water rises, and the tank overflows.
The failure disrupts the physical process.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
This repository instruments OpenPLC to capture calls,
arguments, and values. The trace rows are illustrative.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
The full ICSTracker framework backtracks from overflow
to the pump command, control decision, and false input.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.000
MiniWater: PLC/ICS root cause analysis.
Evidence for targeted investigation and recovery.
ICSTracker, IEEE/IFIP DSN 2025.
